      "id": "claim_9fb760018b274f0392f0a3cd0f3a1bc3",
      "statement": "chatChangeStatuses is the single merge/revert status rule shared by agent replay, chat-doc construction, and the overseer's merge/revert guards: processed strictly in log order, a merge marks everything through mergeThrough as merged, a revert marks revertFrom up to the revert message as reverted, and the earliest marking wins.",
