      "id": "claim_1f8c72c2442748d1ba86be5aa2090845",
      "statement": "Pre-git-storage checkpoints carry observedCodeVersion, and legacyChatBaseVersion anchors the legacy Yjs base at the MAXIMUM referenced version across the checkpoint stamp, tool calls' observedCodeVersion, and legacy merge versions — anchoring lower could silently lose content as Yjs parks unmatched updates as pending structs; this function is migration-internal.",
